3 Visualizations & Expected Results
The primary visual deliverable will be phase-space animations and heatmaps of the Wigner quasiprobability distribution. Beyond that, we plan to verify how the decoherence timescale scales with
the cat separation, reproducing the scaling behavior observed by Brune et al. We can also compare
this dissipation with a pure dephasing channel by modifying the Lindblad jump operator.
